 for Sale In Mumbai](https://www.addressofchoice.com/chheda-group-in-mumbai-cdp2598i1)\n/* [Borivali West](https://www.addressofchoice.com/property-in-borivali-west-mumbai-l1493) \n  + [Properties For Sale In Borivali West](https://www.addressofchoice.com/property-in-borivali-west-mumbai-l1493)\n  + [Apartments Flats Sale In Borivali West](https://www.addressofchoice.com/mumbai/borivali-west/apartments-lpt5l1493)\n  + [House/Villas for sale in Borivali West](https://www.addressofchoice.com/mumbai/borivali-west/villas-lpt7l1493)\n  + [Ready to Move Apartments in Borivali West](https://www.addressofchoice.com/mumbai/borivali-west/ready-to-move-lps4l1493)\n  + [Plots for Sale In Borivali West](https://www.addressofchoice.com/mumbai/borivali-west/plots-lpt6l1493)\n/* Chheda Palladium\n\n## Chheda Palladium\n\n[![location](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/navigate-outline.svg)Borivali West](https://www.addressofchoice.com/property-in-borivali-west-mumbai-l1493) [![Developer](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/business-outline.svg) By: Chheda Group](https://www.addressofchoice.com/property-in-chheda-group-d2598)\n\n![Location](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/location-outline.svg) IC Colony Cross Rd Number 5, I C Colony, Borivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400103.\n\n[![Google](https://www.google.com/favicon.ico) Add As A Preferred  \nSource On Google](https://www.google.com/preferences/source?q=Addressofchoice.com)\n\n[![Save](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/heart-outline.svg)Save](#) [![Review](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/chatbox-outline.svg) Post A Review](#rating)\n\nPrice Range Starting from\n\n###### 2.03 Cr to 3.06 Cr\\*\n\n![Chheda Palladium](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/elevation/56572/1616944581_e1.jpg \"Chheda Palladium\")\n\n# Chheda Palladium in Borivali West, Mumbai Details | Reviews | Price | Floor Plan | Photos | Master Plan | Brochure | Amenities | Location\n\n![Floor Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/gallery-floor-plan.jpg \"Floor Plan\")\n\n![Site Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/gallery-site-plan.jpg \"Site Plan\")\n\n![Chheda Palladium](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/elevation/56572/1616944581_e1.jpg \"Chheda Palladium\")\n\n[![Save](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/heart-outline.svg)Save](#) [![Review](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/chatbox-outline.svg) Post A Review](#rating)\n\n#### Are you interested in property?\n\nGet attractive benefits with addressofchoice.com\n\n* [Highlights](#review)\n* [Overview](#overview)\n* [Units](#price_listWarpper)\n* [Specifications](#specifications)\n* [Locality & Price Trends](#locality)\n* [Related Projects](#Projects)\n* [Developers](#Developers)\n* [Review & Ratings](#rating)\n* [FAQs](#faqs)\n\n2 ,3 ,3.5 BHK Residential Property \n\nEMI Start at ₹\n\nStatus: **Ready to Move**\n\n[![call](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/call-outline.svg) CONTACT NOW](javascript:void(0)) [![home](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/conversation.svg) FAQ's](#faq_Property)\n\n* Apartment Sizes Ranges in Between 653 sqft - 985 sqft.\n* Total Units & Towers: 59 Units & Towers\n* Total Project Area: Acres\n* Possession: June, 2018\n* Rera: P51800009569\n\n## About\n\nChheda Palladium is a remarkable Residential project located in the well-connected Borivali West locality of Mumbai. Spanning Details Available Upon Request, the project features 59 Units in Details Available Upon Request, offering a mix of 2 BHK+2T, to 3.5 BHK+3T Apartments ranging from 653 sqft to 985 sqft. The address for the project is ic colony cross rd number 5, i c colony, borivali west, mumbai, maharashtra 400103..\n\n**Available Property Sizes**\n\nThe Apartments at Chheda Palladium are available in a variety of sizes. The 2 BHK+2T units start at 653 sqft. The larger 3.5 BHK+3T Apartments go up to 985 sqft, providing ample space for families of all sizes.\n\n**Price Range**\n\nThe prices for the Apartments at Chheda Palladium are designed to be accessible, with 2 BHK+2T units priced from 2.03 Cr and 3.5 BHK+3T Apartments from 3.06 Cr, depending on the size and configuration.\n\n**Developer Information**\n\nThe project is being developed by Chheda Group, known for its commitment to quality and timely delivery. RERA registration number for the project is P51800009569 Units. Possession is expected to begin in 2018-06-06, ensuring that the property is well on track for future homeowners.\n\n**Amenities and Features**\n\nChheda Palladium is designed to offer a blend of luxury and convenience. Key sports amenities include a Gym. For relaxation, the development offers a Lifts, Car Parking, Power Back-up, Water Storage, Maintenance Staff, Club house, Garden. The security features include CCTV, Fire Alarm for enhanced safety.\n\n**Construction and Specifications**\n\nThe project is constructed using premium materials such as vitrified tiles for flooring, granite countertops in the kitchens, and high-end sanitary ware in the bathrooms. These materials ensure both durability and elegance in every home.\n\n**Key Information**\n\n* Total Area: Details Available Upon Request\n* Units & Towers: 59 Units, Details Available Upon Request\n* Sizes: 653 sqft to 985 sqft\n* Project Address: ic colony cross rd number 5, i c colony, borivali west, mumbai, maharashtra 400103.\n* Type: Residential Apartments\n* Developer: Chheda Group\n* RERA Registration No.: P51800009569 Units\n* Possession Start: 2018-06-06\n* Construction Quality: Premium materials, vitrified tiles, granite countertops\n* Security: CCTV, Fire Alarm\n* Sports Facilities: Gym\n* Convenience Amenities: Lifts, Car Parking, Power Back-up, Water Storage, Maintenance Staff, Club house, Garden\n\n**Location Benefits**\n\nChheda Palladium benefits from its location in Borivali West, offering great connectivity to schools, hospitals, shopping malls, and public transport systems. This makes it an ideal place to live, especially for families.\n\n**Developer and Project Details**\n\nPossession at Chheda Palladium will begin in 2018-06-06, and the project is RERA registered under P51800009569 Units. Developed by Chheda Group, this project promises a reliable investment for prospective homeowners.\n\n### Sports Amenities\n\n* ![Gym](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804743_gym.svg) Gym\n\n### Convenience Amenities\n\n* ![Lifts](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804644_lift.svg) Lifts\n* ![Car Parking](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804679_parking.svg) Car Parking\n* ![Power Back-up](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528886956_power_back_up.svg) Power Back-up\n* ![Water Storage](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528886749_water_storage.svg) Water Storage\n* ![Maintenance Staff](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804773_maintenance-staff.svg) Maintenance Staff\n* ![Club house](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804551_club-house.svg) Club house\n* ![garden](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804627_garden.svg) Garden\n\n### Safety Amenities\n\n* ![CCTV](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528887020_cctv.svg) CCTV\n* ![Fire Alarm](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804761_fire-alarm.svg) Fire Alarm\n\n## Floor Plans of Chheda Palladium\n\n![Chheda Palladium Floor Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/images/no-image.jpg \"Chheda Palladium Floor Plan 653 sqft\")\n\n2 BHK (653 Sq. Ft.)\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Chheda Palladium Floor Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/images/no-image.jpg \"Chheda Palladium Floor Plan 688 sqft\")\n\n2 BHK (688 Sq. Ft.)\n\nBo